<title>UK: LME copper off lows, spread close to limit.</title>
<headline>LME copper off lows, spread close to limit.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Three months off lows. Tom/next at $24/25 backwardation in 1st ring, near $26 limit, cash/day at $21/22 back, cash/threes offered at $290 back.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Three months touch easier as spreads come out.</p>
<p>Cash/threes at $26/$26.50 vs $21/$22 at Monday close.</p>
<p>TIN - Easier, hovering just off lows.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Little changed/touch down.</p>
</text>
